{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/484653-gadget-balance-question","id":484653,"title":"gadget balance question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-18T09:42:54-07:00","id":484653,"title":"gadget balance question","content":"Would it be better for a gadget to be covered under a merit like a werewolf's fetish or simply cost a point of willpower instead of a dot.<br /> <br /> This way gadgets aren't a vulnerabile experience sink. I'd considered doing a house rule to give gadgets a sanctity of merits like rule (as I've posted here) but after some thought it may be easier to adjust gadgets than add entirely new rules.<br /> <br /> Any feedback on the idea or suggestions what direction would be best? I personally am leaning towards more like a merit for balance in a multi template game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T10:11:42-07:00","id":484708,"title":"","content":"Merit works fine, since gadgets remove a Willpower point and they cost 1XP to replace (same as a Merit dot).<br /> <br /> That said, as written gadgets don't have dot values or variable costs - they cost one Willpower point, equal to an XP. Also the current system lets you make a bunch of 'em even if you don't have any XP - you can pay on the installment plan. <br /> <br /> A willpower point is too cheap. Far, far too cheap. I recover one of those most days, and can easily get more. Gadgets, especially Embedded ones, don't tend to have limited uses or other downsides (unless you want to make one-shots, knock-offs and such, but they're not the default); it's a specific, modified version of your Embed/Exploit that you can give to others. Since demons can permanently absorb Embeds/Exploits by unmaking gadgets.... A willpower point is too low.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T10:35:07-07:00","id":484732,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eremite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/484653-gadget-balance-question?p=484708#post484708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since demons can permanently absorb Embeds/Exploits by unmaking gadgets.... A willpower point is too low.</div> </div> </div> </div>Reverse-engineering a gadget gives you an excuse to spend the Experiences to learn its component Embeds and Exploits. It's not free.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T12:43:53-07:00","id":484811,"title":"","content":"I forgot about reverse engineering. Very good point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}